WEBVTT

01:41.380 --> 01:45.990
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.530 --> 01:48.930
[Episode 38]

01:55.000 --> 01:55.680
Shui!

01:56.229 --> 01:56.950
I'm not dead.

01:57.590 --> 01:58.350
Look at me.

02:01.760 --> 02:02.560
Qingge.

02:03.200 --> 02:03.760
Look,

02:04.770 --> 02:06.000
I'm fine now.

02:06.980 --> 02:08.650
Please don't blame yourself anymore.

02:11.080 --> 02:11.710
You need to leave.

02:11.870 --> 02:13.000
Spirit Spring is about to come back.

02:13.150 --> 02:14.470
I won't be able to control myself at that time.

02:14.710 --> 02:15.470
I don't want to kill you.

02:15.750 --> 02:16.280
You need to go.

02:16.520 --> 02:17.870
Go, please go!

02:20.400 --> 02:21.190
What are you trying to do?

02:24.840 --> 02:25.960
As long as I die,

02:26.680 --> 02:28.400
no one will hurt you again.

02:28.590 --> 02:29.800
It's not like that.

02:29.880 --> 02:31.120
It's not like that.

02:32.540 --> 02:33.950
You didn't hurt me.

02:34.430 --> 02:35.520
Don't you remember?

02:35.920 --> 02:37.110
You defeated the Spirit Spring

02:37.140 --> 02:38.140
and protected me.

02:38.590 --> 02:39.920
I'm still alive.

02:40.220 --> 02:42.220
The Spirit Spring will no longer control you.

02:45.310 --> 02:47.240
I really didn't hurt you again?

03:06.360 --> 03:07.360
You're still alive?

03:08.630 --> 03:09.470
I'm alive.

03:10.360 --> 03:11.710
You don't have to be afraid anymore.

03:12.390 --> 03:14.320
Let's end all the past nightmares.

03:15.150 --> 03:15.800
From now on,

03:16.360 --> 03:17.150
we only need to remember

03:17.150 --> 03:19.030
those sweet memories.

03:21.910 --> 03:23.470
With a tree in front of a house,

03:24.190 --> 03:25.630
it's not just a house

03:26.400 --> 03:27.240
but

03:27.910 --> 03:28.400
a home.

03:29.140 --> 03:31.150
-Yet I still can't get you to call me...
-Master.

03:33.360 --> 03:33.960
Good.

03:36.520 --> 03:41.450
♫Fallen leaves swirling and covering the empty garden♫

03:38.430 --> 03:39.150
What's this?

03:40.710 --> 03:41.360
You found it!

03:41.520 --> 03:42.030
Master,

03:42.190 --> 03:43.280
it's Mr. Right!

03:43.290 --> 03:48.579
♫Clouds and dust rolling in the distant sky♫

03:49.950 --> 03:52.960
♫Generations of dreams fold into one♫

03:53.460 --> 03:56.579
♫Demon or immortal?♫

03:55.740 --> 03:57.840
[Master is the best in the universe]

03:56.990 --> 04:02.640
♫With you by my side, I'm fearless in the face of life's hardships♫

03:58.880 --> 04:00.160
The lanterns filling the room

04:01.300 --> 04:02.090
are my answer.

04:03.800 --> 04:04.520
I think

04:03.850 --> 04:07.110
♫If love wants me to die♫

04:05.850 --> 04:06.760
I must have had feelings

04:07.560 --> 04:08.910
for you before.

04:07.660 --> 04:10.720
♫I won't give up because of you♫

04:10.520 --> 04:11.080
Look,

04:10.740 --> 04:12.650
♫Thousands of steps to cross the sky-high chasm♫

04:11.470 --> 04:12.680
both in the past life and this life,

04:12.680 --> 04:16.700
♫Reincarnation and fate can't be denied♫

04:12.750 --> 04:13.560
someone you love is always here for you.

04:16.720 --> 04:20.800
♫Why does the world have everything but love?♫

04:19.070 --> 04:19.720
Ranran,

04:20.750 --> 04:22.510
I used to complain about the unfairness of fate,

04:21.290 --> 04:24.260
♫Falling forever is like becoming immortal♫

04:23.270 --> 04:24.720
but in fact, what I've longed for all my life

04:24.770 --> 04:30.880
♫I insist to be with you day after day♫

04:26.120 --> 04:27.160
has always been by my side.

04:41.720 --> 04:42.310
Ranran.

04:43.000 --> 04:43.630
Qingge.

04:44.800 --> 04:45.430
I'm here.

04:44.950 --> 04:48.220
♫If love wants me to die♫

04:45.560 --> 04:46.159
I'm here.

04:46.360 --> 04:47.040
I'm here.

04:48.760 --> 04:51.820
♫I won't give up because of you♫

04:51.850 --> 04:53.760
♫Thousands of steps to cross the sky-high chasm♫

04:53.790 --> 04:58.120
♫Reincarnation and fate can't be denied♫

04:58.610 --> 05:02.440
♫The world bears witness as obsession finally finds its bond♫

05:02.460 --> 05:05.370
♫We'll be together again when the flowers bloom♫

05:05.570 --> 05:11.880
♫The moment between us is worth 10,000 years♫

05:18.940 --> 05:20.710
Ranran made it at the last moment.

05:20.770 --> 05:21.500
That's great.

05:27.240 --> 05:28.070
How is he?

05:34.360 --> 05:35.240
The nightmare has been dispelled.

05:35.409 --> 05:36.409
He can now accept the Golden Core.

05:59.920 --> 06:00.430
Your Highness,

06:00.880 --> 06:02.010
be careful not to get burned by the fire.

06:02.040 --> 06:03.330
I know that's fire!

06:06.290 --> 06:07.270
Everything else I see

06:07.270 --> 06:08.270
is all gray and hazy.

06:10.510 --> 06:12.160
Only this patch of bright red

06:12.760 --> 06:13.640
is dancing,

06:14.280 --> 06:16.600
which really brings joy to me.

06:17.830 --> 06:18.830
My body

06:20.000 --> 06:21.070
is so numb that I can't even

06:21.070 --> 06:22.600
feel pain anymore.

06:23.310 --> 06:24.560
So I want to try

06:25.800 --> 06:27.430
putting this flesh into the fire

06:28.870 --> 06:30.040
to see if I can still feel pain.

06:30.070 --> 06:31.360
Your Highness, Your Highness!

06:36.360 --> 06:37.480
Come, get up.

06:46.920 --> 06:47.800
Xueyan.

06:49.120 --> 06:50.360
Have you ever thought about one thing?

06:51.650 --> 06:52.480
If you could go back

06:52.510 --> 06:54.390
and start over at a certain moment in this life,

06:55.070 --> 06:56.159
which moment would you choose?

06:57.870 --> 06:58.630
I

06:59.390 --> 07:00.480
have never thought about it.

07:01.560 --> 07:02.630
Life can't be reversed.

07:02.800 --> 07:03.390
No!

07:04.390 --> 07:05.960
There are countless possibilities in life.

07:07.070 --> 07:07.950
Among the Three Thousand Realms,

07:08.360 --> 07:09.000
there is always

07:09.020 --> 07:10.980
the most suitable starting point to begin anew.

07:13.360 --> 07:13.870
Su Yu,

07:14.200 --> 07:15.840
you've been nurturing demons in the palace, corrupting the Heavenly Way.

07:15.870 --> 07:17.120
We'll uphold justice on behalf of Heaven!

07:26.770 --> 07:27.650
Don't touch her.

07:29.160 --> 07:29.800
Xueyan,

07:31.480 --> 07:32.390
come to me.

07:38.100 --> 07:39.420
My dear third brother

07:40.450 --> 07:41.450
has just found an excuse

07:41.480 --> 07:42.720
to be released by Father,

07:43.560 --> 07:44.510
and now he's so eager

07:44.510 --> 07:45.510
to make his move, isn't he?

07:50.909 --> 07:52.030
Why don't you deal with them?

07:52.560 --> 07:53.159
Is it because

07:53.310 --> 07:54.670
you want to go to the so-called Three Thousand Realms?

07:55.070 --> 07:56.680
So everything here

07:56.700 --> 07:57.990
doesn't matter to you anymore?

08:01.070 --> 08:02.040
Zhou Feihua,

08:03.600 --> 08:05.360
what business do you have here?

08:05.830 --> 08:07.240
When did you realize it was me?

08:07.630 --> 08:08.680
I couldn't see clearly,

08:09.560 --> 08:10.560
but from the very beginning,

08:10.560 --> 08:12.560
I sensed your figure and energy.

08:12.800 --> 08:14.530
After all, we're too familiar with each other.

08:15.800 --> 08:17.680
Today, you drew your sword for me again.

08:19.230 --> 08:20.640
How could I not recognize you?

08:22.720 --> 08:23.390
Are you

08:24.890 --> 08:26.450
that reluctant to let me go?

08:41.840 --> 08:45.010
[Qiongqi Village]

08:46.550 --> 08:47.080
Your Highness!

08:49.600 --> 08:50.120
Your Highness.

08:50.720 --> 08:51.240
Your Highness,

08:51.390 --> 08:52.030
you're awake.

08:52.360 --> 08:52.840
Your Highness.

08:53.390 --> 08:53.960
Where is this?

08:54.670 --> 08:55.320
Your Highness,

08:55.510 --> 08:56.630
this place is far from the capital,

08:56.840 --> 08:57.630
quiet and secluded.

08:57.910 --> 08:59.510
You can rest here peacefully.

09:00.670 --> 09:01.440
How dare you!

09:03.110 --> 09:04.750
How dare you abduct me.

09:06.200 --> 09:07.630
Do you know what crime you've committed?

09:15.930 --> 09:17.600
Take him away and hide him well.

09:26.510 --> 09:27.630
This place is remote and mountainous.

09:28.030 --> 09:29.670
There's also a barrier specifically set up to prevent you from leaving.

09:30.770 --> 09:31.770
You can't go back.

09:32.470 --> 09:33.230
Why?

09:35.240 --> 09:36.120
Zhou Feihua,

09:37.270 --> 09:38.720
are you taking revenge on me?

09:41.870 --> 09:42.910
Let me go back.

09:44.590 --> 09:45.710
I want to go back!

09:46.250 --> 09:47.530
Just for the Three Thousand Realms?

09:50.210 --> 09:51.240
Qingge once said,

09:51.650 --> 09:52.890
everything has its rules.

09:53.320 --> 09:54.150
Going against heaven

09:54.170 --> 09:55.480
surely comes with a price.

09:56.270 --> 09:56.960
Did the one who told you

09:56.960 --> 09:58.080
that everything would change

09:58.340 --> 09:59.620
tell you about the cost?

10:04.750 --> 10:06.110
You know it but refuse to say it out.

10:06.930 --> 10:07.690
It must be

10:07.720 --> 10:09.030
an extremely tragic price,

10:09.710 --> 10:10.230
isn't it?

10:19.720 --> 10:20.390
Your Highness,

10:21.080 --> 10:22.120
do you know what this is for?

10:23.590 --> 10:24.920
The flood in Qizhou has been brought under control.

10:25.750 --> 10:27.350
It's because the Surplus Field Decree you enacted three years ago,

10:27.670 --> 10:28.790
regardless of the opposition from the local gentry,

10:29.190 --> 10:30.980
has taken effect.

10:31.670 --> 10:34.000
Both officials and commoners have stored surplus grain

10:34.200 --> 10:35.390
to withstand the disaster.

10:36.270 --> 10:38.080
Your Highness, this is a great virtue.

10:38.510 --> 10:39.800
The people are endlessly grateful.

10:40.190 --> 10:41.080
Firecrackers and fireworks are being set off in celebration

10:41.080 --> 10:42.670
everywhere

10:43.540 --> 10:44.700
to pray for you.

10:46.440 --> 10:49.200
You still have the people in your heart.

11:00.700 --> 11:01.910
It's Su Yishui!

11:02.360 --> 11:03.630
Su Yishui is too cunning!

11:03.680 --> 11:04.630
He deceived us!

11:06.910 --> 11:08.030
I will definitely bring Su Yu

11:08.150 --> 11:10.190
back to you, Uncle Ye Xin.

11:10.940 --> 11:12.060
You couldn't even keep an eye on him!

11:12.960 --> 11:14.680
As if I would still expect you to find him.

11:17.870 --> 11:18.630
I know

11:19.400 --> 11:21.400
you've sent people to catch the Green Dragon.

11:28.670 --> 11:29.670
With my energy,

11:30.510 --> 11:32.270
I can find the Nine-Pupil Merfolk Pearl that the Green Dragon

11:32.290 --> 11:33.890
can't resist craving for.

11:34.040 --> 11:35.110
Using it as bait,

11:35.680 --> 11:37.170
I absolutely won't let him get away.

11:39.960 --> 11:40.770
Release Wu.

11:41.670 --> 11:42.320
Let me...

11:42.540 --> 11:43.780
I'll help you catch the Green Dragon.

11:49.790 --> 11:50.390
Wu.

11:53.000 --> 11:53.960
No!

11:57.080 --> 11:57.790
Don't panic.

11:58.150 --> 11:58.840
Just now,

11:58.870 --> 11:59.550
I merely

11:59.550 --> 12:00.720
helped her unlock her spiritual power

12:00.890 --> 12:02.370
and infused her with power.

12:02.670 --> 12:03.320
After all,

12:03.680 --> 12:04.830
to catch the Green Dragon,

12:05.080 --> 12:06.400
enormous power is needed.

12:07.390 --> 12:08.820
I agree to your deal.

12:19.480 --> 12:20.000
Wu,

12:21.630 --> 12:22.550
you're fine now.

12:24.670 --> 12:25.390
Just now,

12:26.280 --> 12:27.090
I also

12:27.120 --> 12:28.320
cast a Life-Death Spell on her.

12:29.440 --> 12:30.510
If within five days,

12:30.510 --> 12:31.600
the Green Dragon is not found,

12:32.000 --> 12:33.240
Wu will surely

12:33.670 --> 12:35.600
die a painful death.

12:37.240 --> 12:37.870
Don't worry.

12:38.520 --> 12:39.690
Five days is enough.

12:41.000 --> 12:42.000
I won't let you die.

12:58.790 --> 12:59.600
Shui.

13:06.720 --> 13:07.440
Ranran.

13:14.750 --> 13:16.320
I'm so glad you're all right.

13:44.550 --> 13:45.720
It's Master's sound transmission talisman.

13:46.170 --> 13:47.290
The library of the Eternal Sect

13:47.320 --> 13:48.840
might have records of the Two-headed Deceptive Python.

13:49.240 --> 13:50.080
Go quickly,

13:50.420 --> 13:52.330
and remember to be careful.

13:53.550 --> 13:54.670
It seems your master

13:54.740 --> 13:55.790
has already conquered Spirit Spring.

13:56.150 --> 13:56.910
That's great.

13:57.670 --> 13:58.740
Once we find the clues,

13:58.970 --> 13:59.970
we'll immediately go to meet Ranran

14:00.000 --> 14:00.790
and Master.

14:01.080 --> 14:01.630
Wait.

14:02.340 --> 14:03.810
The entire Eternal Sect

14:03.840 --> 14:05.000
is controlled by shadow people.

14:05.480 --> 14:07.170
We need to come up with a foolproof plan.

14:07.750 --> 14:08.270
Oh, right.

14:08.480 --> 14:09.690
With his Earth-Burrowing Armor,

14:09.720 --> 14:11.000
Senior Bai could even break into the Eastern Palace before.

14:11.220 --> 14:11.810
Now we

14:11.840 --> 14:12.910
also have Mr. Zeng with us.

14:13.080 --> 14:14.510
We'll definitely be able to successfully sneak into the Eternal Sect.

14:15.550 --> 14:16.440
Xi'er is right.

14:17.700 --> 14:18.430
We're counting on you.

14:21.600 --> 14:22.120
Look at you,

14:23.030 --> 14:23.550
not bad.

14:25.090 --> 14:25.960
Let's split up and search.

14:26.170 --> 14:26.600
Yes.

14:36.990 --> 14:37.920
I found it!

14:43.360 --> 14:44.690
The book says to defeat shadow people,

14:44.720 --> 14:45.320
we just need to find

14:45.340 --> 14:46.340
the first infected person.

14:46.630 --> 14:47.960
After killing his shadow person,

14:47.980 --> 14:48.600
the rest of the shadow people

14:48.630 --> 14:49.600
will also be eliminated.

14:51.120 --> 14:51.630
Great.

14:51.910 --> 14:52.390
Let's hurry

14:52.390 --> 14:53.240
and bring this news back.

14:58.840 --> 15:00.390
Your power has recovered so quickly.

15:01.030 --> 15:01.630
Very good.

15:02.150 --> 15:02.750
Give it to me.

15:08.270 --> 15:09.000
Let me go.

15:09.670 --> 15:10.390
Let go!

15:16.960 --> 15:18.720
Let me go. Let go.

15:19.030 --> 15:19.790
Let go!

15:27.870 --> 15:28.720
It was just a dream.

15:32.750 --> 15:34.160
My spiritual power has weakened.

15:36.440 --> 15:38.110
He actually invaded my dream,

15:38.370 --> 15:39.640
stealing my spiritual power.

15:54.080 --> 15:55.200
You still

15:56.030 --> 15:57.200
took the Nine-Pupil Merfolk Pearl away.

15:59.790 --> 16:00.510
Wu!

16:02.380 --> 16:05.020
[Leisure]

16:15.670 --> 16:16.320
What's wrong?

16:17.750 --> 16:18.840
I have some questions.

16:21.270 --> 16:22.320
Do you still remember

16:22.800 --> 16:23.930
the origin of the Ice Lotus Pool?

16:25.150 --> 16:26.000
Back then,

16:26.030 --> 16:26.720
to suppress

16:26.750 --> 16:27.840
the drop of Spirit Spring in my heart,

16:28.150 --> 16:29.270
you went alone to Jade Peak on Sky Mountain

16:29.270 --> 16:30.200
to retrieve it for me.

16:31.030 --> 16:32.110
Then do you remember

16:32.430 --> 16:33.480
the lanterns I made for you?

16:33.870 --> 16:35.510
Every time I returned late to Mount Wester,

16:35.750 --> 16:37.030
you would always leave a light for me,

16:37.600 --> 16:38.750
illuminating the path ahead.

16:39.440 --> 16:40.650
In the cave at Wuma Town,

16:41.080 --> 16:42.240
you lit up the lanterns

16:42.270 --> 16:43.510
filling the cave for me.

16:44.120 --> 16:45.080
However, in this life,

16:45.510 --> 16:46.600
you forgot the past

16:47.080 --> 16:48.080
and angrily punctured

16:48.080 --> 16:49.320
the lanterns I had made for you.

16:51.320 --> 16:52.440
Only afterward did you learn

16:52.680 --> 16:53.330
that you were actually

16:53.360 --> 16:54.440
jealous of yourself.

16:54.960 --> 16:55.790
Then do you remember

16:56.030 --> 16:57.600
how you abducted me to Mount Wester

16:58.440 --> 16:59.720
and how many times I gave you

17:00.360 --> 17:01.550
the wooden hairpin in your hair?

17:02.320 --> 17:03.410
Can you recall all of that?

17:04.109 --> 17:04.750
So,

17:05.550 --> 17:06.440
you're worried about

17:06.440 --> 17:07.310
whether I've regained my memories or not.

17:12.119 --> 17:13.030
I remember everything now.

17:13.920 --> 17:14.829
Every single thing

17:15.790 --> 17:16.880
and every little detail about us

17:17.270 --> 17:18.160
are all etched in my heart.

17:18.579 --> 17:19.970
I will never forget them in this lifetime.

17:20.480 --> 17:22.349
Only when you fall in love with me again

17:22.780 --> 17:24.270
will the Soul-Cleansing Charm be broken.

17:24.880 --> 17:25.510
So,

17:25.960 --> 17:27.069
to avoid hurting me,

17:27.670 --> 17:29.320
you were willing to shatter your own Golden Core.

17:30.200 --> 17:30.790
For my sake,

17:31.550 --> 17:33.350
at that moment when you were willing to sacrifice everything,

17:34.180 --> 17:35.770
you remembered everything, didn't you?

17:36.550 --> 17:37.440
Fortunately, this time,

17:37.680 --> 17:38.750
I didn't hurt you again.

17:38.960 --> 17:39.790
What do you mean by "fortunately"?

17:40.640 --> 17:41.880
If I had known it would be this dangerous

17:42.000 --> 17:43.440
to break the Soul-Cleansing Charm,

17:43.750 --> 17:45.480
I would rather you hadn't remembered the past.

17:45.790 --> 17:47.440
I only wish for your safety and well-being.

17:47.680 --> 17:48.440
That won't do.

17:49.070 --> 17:49.680
If only you remembered

17:49.680 --> 17:50.550
everything about our past,

17:50.830 --> 17:51.960
wouldn't I be at a disadvantage?

17:57.030 --> 17:57.960
Until I became a devil,

17:58.000 --> 17:59.030
hearing those words you said,

18:00.030 --> 18:00.830
I finally understood

18:01.480 --> 18:02.680
that when you took my Spirit Spring back then,

18:03.160 --> 18:04.310
it was to protect all living beings.

18:05.790 --> 18:06.880
But it was also because you saw

18:06.880 --> 18:08.160
in the Heavenly Book that I would forever fall into devilry,

18:08.510 --> 18:09.740
ending in the complete destruction of both body and spirit.

18:10.270 --> 18:11.310
You wanted to save me.

18:13.400 --> 18:14.550
Even if it meant defying the Heavenly Way,

18:15.400 --> 18:16.830
you also wanted to change my fate.

18:18.000 --> 18:18.750
I had no idea

18:20.030 --> 18:21.240
about these things.

18:23.720 --> 18:24.960
You've done so much for me,

18:26.480 --> 18:27.510
yet I knew nothing about it.

18:28.830 --> 18:29.510
Shui,

18:31.880 --> 18:33.030
in your nightmare,

18:33.580 --> 18:35.010
I saw your inner devil.

18:36.200 --> 18:37.720
You've always felt guilty towards me.

18:38.200 --> 18:38.880
You think,

18:39.700 --> 18:40.610
if from the beginning,

18:40.640 --> 18:41.750
I had never met you,

18:42.420 --> 18:43.340
I would have been better off.

18:43.680 --> 18:44.480
Right?

18:47.270 --> 18:48.320
It's not like that.

18:48.960 --> 18:50.650
Have you ever thought about the exact opposite of your thoughts?

18:51.520 --> 18:52.170
I'm grateful

18:52.200 --> 18:53.400
that I can meet you.

18:54.110 --> 18:55.830
Whether in the past life or this one,

18:56.400 --> 18:57.270
I'm always grateful.

18:58.000 --> 18:59.510
There have been twists and turns

18:59.920 --> 19:00.790
along the way,

19:01.190 --> 19:02.300
but in our lives,

19:02.790 --> 19:04.640
how can everything go exactly as we wish?

19:05.310 --> 19:06.880
These experiences we've shared together

19:07.440 --> 19:08.480
actually make me think

19:08.960 --> 19:10.110
each day we spend together

19:10.790 --> 19:11.830
is vivid

19:12.440 --> 19:13.480
and beyond precious.

19:23.520 --> 19:28.540
♫Maybe a lifetime is too short, too fleeting♫

19:28.560 --> 19:33.800
♫So we were granted a second chance♫

19:34.160 --> 19:39.210
♫Using the unfinished fate♫

19:39.390 --> 19:44.410
♫To exchange for endless reunions♫

19:39.570 --> 19:40.040
I

19:40.720 --> 19:42.030
have prepared some medicinal food for you.

19:42.440 --> 19:43.440
Please eat it while it's hot.

19:44.830 --> 19:49.460
♫Just because I'm destined to reunite with you again♫

19:47.550 --> 19:48.400
Shui,

19:48.750 --> 19:49.400
let go.

19:50.200 --> 19:54.750
♫Intertwined fates throughout reincarnation♫

19:50.720 --> 19:51.680
Respect your master

19:51.880 --> 19:52.920
and listen to your master.

19:53.270 --> 19:54.640
Or I'll have to punish you.

19:55.580 --> 20:00.500
♫With endless time to write our story♫

19:55.680 --> 19:56.310
Master?

19:57.590 --> 19:58.680
Are you the master,

19:59.000 --> 19:59.920
or am I the master?

20:00.640 --> 20:01.880
What should I do with that?

20:00.810 --> 20:04.740
♫We fulfill the vow forged through many lifetimes♫

20:02.720 --> 20:04.480
I took you as my disciple first.

20:04.720 --> 20:05.960
There must be an order of precedence.

20:05.180 --> 20:10.230
♫From now onwards♫

20:06.200 --> 20:07.200
Of course, I am the master.

20:07.590 --> 20:08.550
And you should listen to what I say.

20:10.110 --> 20:10.750
All right.

20:11.310 --> 20:11.960
However,

20:12.440 --> 20:14.000
there's also a term in this world called 'rebellious disciple,'

20:14.880 --> 20:15.750
and as it happens,

20:17.640 --> 20:18.480
that's exactly what I am.

20:27.750 --> 20:28.510
Dragon Goddess.

20:28.760 --> 20:29.390
It seems

20:29.420 --> 20:31.100
Su Yishui's matter has been resolved.

20:31.790 --> 20:33.000
So I can rest assured now.

20:33.700 --> 20:34.920
Thank you for your concern, Dragon Goddess.

20:35.420 --> 20:37.010
I've caused a lot of trouble for Dragon Island.

20:37.480 --> 20:39.310
You are Qing Luo's lifesavers.

20:40.000 --> 20:41.270
As long as everything turns out well in the end,

20:41.640 --> 20:42.880
it's all fine.

20:44.200 --> 20:44.920
Qing Luo...

20:45.940 --> 20:46.850
This reminds me of

20:46.880 --> 20:47.510
an important matter.

20:47.830 --> 20:49.400
Dun Tian wants to open the Three Thousand Realms Tower.

20:49.750 --> 20:50.720
Besides several major spiritual channels,

20:51.000 --> 20:52.110
he also needs to sacrifice the blood of the Three Children.

20:52.650 --> 20:53.310
I saw this

20:53.310 --> 20:54.550
on Dragon Island that day.

20:55.110 --> 20:56.750
Dun Tian needs the Child of the True Devil.

20:57.360 --> 20:58.450
That's why he's been trying

20:58.480 --> 20:59.270
to lead you into becoming a devil.

20:59.790 --> 21:00.920
The Child of the Human Emperor

21:01.200 --> 21:02.350
is naturally Su Yu.

21:02.960 --> 21:04.200
But the third child...

21:05.200 --> 21:05.830
The third one

21:07.110 --> 21:07.920
is the Child of the Divine Dragon.

21:08.680 --> 21:09.790
The Child of the Divine Dragon?

21:10.080 --> 21:11.790
I previously learned from Dun Tian by tricking him...

21:12.440 --> 21:13.880
To open the Three Thousand Realms Tower,

21:14.400 --> 21:15.310
I must gather

21:15.960 --> 21:16.880
the Child of the Human Emperor,

21:17.270 --> 21:18.200
the Child of the Divine Dragon,

21:18.550 --> 21:19.200
and you.

21:20.140 --> 21:21.530
Although the devilish nature within me has been removed

21:21.800 --> 21:22.410
and I will no longer become

21:22.440 --> 21:23.270
the devil's child he desires,

21:23.970 --> 21:24.640
that day,

21:24.640 --> 21:25.790
I still let the Spirit Spring escape.

21:26.310 --> 21:27.600
Dun Tian has been lying low for so many years.

21:28.240 --> 21:29.550
He may have other preparations.

21:30.270 --> 21:30.880
So I think

21:31.200 --> 21:32.240
Dragon Island should batten down the hatches.

21:32.680 --> 21:33.680
Please be careful, Dragon Goddess.

21:34.070 --> 21:35.790
Qing Luo and the others are playing at the edge of the island.

21:36.310 --> 21:37.790
I'll go call them back right away

21:38.310 --> 21:39.750
and strengthen the barrier around Dragon Island

21:40.070 --> 21:41.030
just in case.

21:44.400 --> 21:45.400
Dun Tian needs Three Children

21:45.590 --> 21:47.030
to open the Three Thousand Realms Tower.

21:47.310 --> 21:48.790
I'm afraid he won't let you go easily.

21:49.000 --> 21:49.880
You still need to be careful.

21:56.000 --> 21:56.920
Let's get back to what we were trying to do...

22:05.270 --> 22:06.400
Something happened at Mount Wester.

22:07.000 --> 22:08.000
Zeng Yi and Gao Cang

22:08.070 --> 22:09.480
have already arrived at the foot of Mount Cuiwei.

22:12.350 --> 22:13.240
-Master.
-Master.

22:13.350 --> 22:13.790
Ranran.

22:14.550 --> 22:15.480
What exactly happened?

22:15.920 --> 22:16.790
There are good news

22:17.000 --> 22:17.880
and bad news.

22:18.240 --> 22:18.750
The good news is that

22:18.750 --> 22:19.440
we have found

22:19.440 --> 22:20.640
a way to eliminate shadow people.

22:21.030 --> 22:22.270
As long as we kill the first shadow person

22:22.310 --> 22:23.550
replicated by the Two-headed Deceptive Python,

22:23.880 --> 22:24.750
the rest of the shadow people

22:25.030 --> 22:26.000
will naturally disappear.

22:27.110 --> 22:28.000
In other words,

22:28.400 --> 22:29.510
we need to find a way to identify

22:29.550 --> 22:30.680
who the first shadow person is.

22:31.310 --> 22:32.240
This is indeed good news.

22:32.590 --> 22:33.350
What about the bad news?

22:33.920 --> 22:34.510
We originally planned

22:34.550 --> 22:35.550
to return to Mount Wester first

22:35.750 --> 22:37.200
to inform all the major sects about this news.

22:37.790 --> 22:39.070
But as soon as we reached the mountain gate,

22:39.350 --> 22:40.510
we found blue bloodstains.

22:41.310 --> 22:43.070
I didn't expect they would still attack Mount Wester.

22:43.750 --> 22:44.270
Were any of you

22:44.270 --> 22:45.440
touched by that blue blood?

22:46.480 --> 22:47.640
Fortunately, you gave us

22:47.640 --> 22:49.160
specially made pills to take.

22:49.510 --> 22:50.960
The fragrance of the pills lasted for a long time,

22:51.560 --> 22:52.080
so the shadow people

22:52.110 --> 22:53.310
couldn't imitate our scent.

22:54.070 --> 22:54.960
What about the others?

22:55.650 --> 22:56.850
When we rushed to the mountain,

22:56.880 --> 22:57.920
we sensed

22:57.920 --> 22:58.640
something was wrong

22:58.660 --> 22:59.660
thanks to the fragrance of the pills.

22:59.960 --> 23:01.110
We were ready to face the enemy,

23:01.480 --> 23:02.200
but unexpectedly,

23:02.440 --> 23:03.400
we didn't even see

23:03.400 --> 23:04.200
any of the enemy.

23:04.410 --> 23:05.080
The blue blood

23:05.110 --> 23:06.510
rained down on us like a shower.

23:06.920 --> 23:08.070
Many people were affected.

23:08.440 --> 23:09.480
Ms. Wen Hongshan

23:09.480 --> 23:10.110
and Mr. Yan Liangyu

23:10.130 --> 23:11.380
had to find an opportunity

23:11.510 --> 23:12.440
to activate the evacuation formation,

23:12.460 --> 23:13.810
thus escaping with some cultivators.

23:14.240 --> 23:16.030
They're now temporarily sheltering in a manor at the foot of the mountain.

23:17.200 --> 23:18.270
I didn't expect

23:18.760 --> 23:20.550
that Mount Wester would ultimately fail to defend itself.

23:21.560 --> 23:22.450
Fortunately, at Mount Cuiwei,

23:22.480 --> 23:23.480
a barrier has already been set up.

23:23.830 --> 23:24.590
But we still can't be careless

23:24.830 --> 23:26.070
about the shadow people.

23:26.590 --> 23:27.510
Mount Wester has fallen.

23:27.960 --> 23:28.720
The five spiritual channels

23:28.750 --> 23:30.030
are now in Dun Tian's hands.

23:30.240 --> 23:31.000
His plan,

23:31.200 --> 23:32.510
I'm afraid, has advanced another step.

23:33.000 --> 23:34.550
Right now, eliminating the first shadow person

23:35.110 --> 23:36.000
is the fastest way

23:36.020 --> 23:36.780
to reclaim the spiritual channels.

23:37.550 --> 23:38.030
Who's there?

23:45.030 --> 23:46.310
Be careful, he might be a shadow man.

23:47.240 --> 23:48.830
With such weak spiritual power,

23:49.190 --> 23:50.620
you still dare to lurk around here?

23:51.200 --> 23:52.270
Lurk around?

23:52.790 --> 23:54.270
I'm here to seek cooperation.

23:54.960 --> 23:55.720
I know

23:55.720 --> 23:56.750
who the first shadow person is.

23:57.640 --> 23:58.120
Let me...

23:59.110 --> 24:00.400
Let me go quickly!

24:08.030 --> 24:09.310
It seems you're not an impostor.

24:15.790 --> 24:16.680
That day, I

24:16.920 --> 24:18.000
encountered the Two-headed Deceptive Python.

24:18.380 --> 24:19.670
I thought it had harmed Tu Jiuyuan,

24:19.920 --> 24:21.240
so I angrily cut off its head.

24:22.070 --> 24:23.920
My hands were stained with the strange snake's blood.

24:24.620 --> 24:25.910
So you mean

24:26.030 --> 24:27.000
your shadow man

24:27.030 --> 24:27.830
is the source?

24:32.560 --> 24:33.310
More or less.

24:33.350 --> 24:33.880
I am probably

24:33.910 --> 24:34.910
the first one who was affected.

24:35.440 --> 24:36.030
Shadow people

24:36.030 --> 24:37.510
are infected and replicated

24:38.200 --> 24:39.030
by the blue blood of the Two-headed Deceptive Python.

24:39.640 --> 24:40.720
After you killed it,

24:40.830 --> 24:41.830
the blue blood came into existence.

24:42.590 --> 24:43.550
Then undoubtedly,

24:43.960 --> 24:44.790
you are indeed the first one.

24:45.790 --> 24:46.550
You don't know.

24:47.080 --> 24:48.400
At that time, the impostor

24:48.640 --> 24:49.880
couldn't kill me on the spot.

24:50.350 --> 24:51.400
Instead, it used

24:51.640 --> 24:53.720
another more vicious method to torment me.

24:54.200 --> 24:55.160
He took advantage of your sleep,

24:55.510 --> 24:56.400
transformed into a nightmare,

24:56.590 --> 24:57.480
and stole your spiritual power.

24:58.000 --> 24:59.000
That's right.

25:00.200 --> 25:01.400
Every time I close my eyes,

25:01.880 --> 25:02.680
I can see someone

25:03.040 --> 25:03.690
who looks exactly

25:03.720 --> 25:04.690
like myself

25:05.110 --> 25:07.000
choke my neck and feed on me.

25:11.030 --> 25:11.790
What are you looking at?

25:13.510 --> 25:14.790
To guard against the impostor,

25:15.000 --> 25:16.230
I haven't closed my eyes for several days.

25:19.070 --> 25:20.070
What's more infuriating

25:20.550 --> 25:21.070
is that he...

25:23.930 --> 25:25.000
Why do I smell

25:25.030 --> 25:26.070
such a strong sour smell?

25:26.750 --> 25:27.310
I

25:27.400 --> 25:28.170
have no other choice

25:28.200 --> 25:28.920
but to come to you.

25:29.590 --> 25:30.680
Otherwise, do you think

25:30.760 --> 25:31.560
I want to come and watch you two

25:31.590 --> 25:32.640
being lovey-dovey here?

25:33.550 --> 25:34.270
Just tell me.

25:34.920 --> 25:36.160
Are all these strange occurrences

25:36.550 --> 25:37.830
related to

25:37.960 --> 25:38.790
that Dun Tian?

25:39.760 --> 25:40.280
That's correct.

25:41.030 --> 25:42.270
Then I finally found the right person.

25:43.000 --> 25:43.830
In the netherworld,

25:44.000 --> 25:45.090
he specifically targeted you.

25:45.550 --> 25:46.070
It's clear

25:46.270 --> 25:47.680
that he's coming specifically for you.

25:49.250 --> 25:50.180
After all,

25:50.510 --> 25:52.030
my current miserable situation

25:52.400 --> 25:52.960
is all your fault.

25:54.070 --> 25:54.640
Su Yishui,

25:55.240 --> 25:56.590
if you don't solve all these troubles

25:56.830 --> 25:58.200
for me,

25:58.590 --> 25:59.720
and if I'm tortured to death,

25:59.880 --> 26:01.270
I'll haunt you even as a ghost.

26:01.640 --> 26:02.270
You don't need to tell me.

26:03.170 --> 26:03.930
Because of the Two-headed Deceptive Python,

26:03.960 --> 26:04.680
so many people have died.

26:05.250 --> 26:05.810
Of course, we will

26:05.840 --> 26:07.040
resolve this crisis as soon as possible.

26:07.720 --> 26:08.510
However,

26:08.920 --> 26:10.750
what is Dun Tian trying to do

26:11.310 --> 26:12.200
by creating so many imposters?

26:12.750 --> 26:13.960
He wants to use shadow people

26:14.110 --> 26:15.110
to control the Heavenly Sects,

26:15.440 --> 26:16.400
open the spiritual channels of the immortal mountains

26:16.400 --> 26:17.310
of the Four Heavenly Sects,

26:17.750 --> 26:18.750
and build the Three Thousand Realms Tower.

26:20.090 --> 26:21.200
Three Thousand Realms Tower?

26:21.880 --> 26:22.680
What the hell is that?

26:23.510 --> 26:25.030
There are truly Three Thousand Realms in the world.

26:25.350 --> 26:26.440
Each realm has its own universe.

26:27.110 --> 26:27.750
In each realm,

26:27.750 --> 26:29.110
there exist different versions of us,

26:30.030 --> 26:31.550
even different Immortal Realms.

26:32.470 --> 26:33.400
Three Thousand Realms Tower

26:33.790 --> 26:34.350
is the entrance

26:34.350 --> 26:35.750
to those three thousand parallel realms.

26:36.680 --> 26:37.720
In each realm,

26:38.100 --> 26:39.210
there are different versions of us?

26:41.960 --> 26:42.480
So...

26:44.830 --> 26:46.000
Does Dun Tian want to...

26:46.480 --> 26:48.000
He wants to enter the Three Thousand Realms Tower

26:49.560 --> 26:50.350
to find a parallel realm

26:50.370 --> 26:51.720
that satisfies him.

26:52.550 --> 26:53.350
In that realm,

26:53.750 --> 26:54.790
he didn't choose ascension

26:55.310 --> 26:56.510
but stayed with his wife and daughter,

26:56.880 --> 26:58.350
enjoying family happiness together.

26:59.960 --> 27:00.880
Dun Tian regretted his choice.

27:01.590 --> 27:03.110
He wants to replace his other self in that realm

27:04.170 --> 27:04.930
and start over.

27:05.550 --> 27:07.280
I didn't know such a remedy for regret existed in the universe.

27:09.270 --> 27:10.750
The realms are originally independent of each other

27:11.030 --> 27:12.030
and not interconnected.

27:12.640 --> 27:13.830
If one forcibly crosses over,

27:14.480 --> 27:17.000
there will be a huge price to pay.

27:17.590 --> 27:19.010
That is to completely destroy

27:19.030 --> 27:20.550
the realm we are in.

27:21.160 --> 27:22.110
Only when our realm

27:22.110 --> 27:22.960
becomes nothingness

27:23.370 --> 27:25.130
will a corner of the Three Thousand Realms Tower

27:25.400 --> 27:26.590
completely collapse.

27:27.480 --> 27:28.370
Its passage

27:28.730 --> 27:30.000
will then truly open.

27:31.750 --> 27:33.070
He treated me like a pawn,

27:33.270 --> 27:34.640
using me to help him release the Mortal-Demon Lord's child.

27:35.070 --> 27:36.070
Now he wants to erase

27:36.070 --> 27:37.070
everything I've earned

27:37.200 --> 27:39.110
with great difficulty!

27:39.790 --> 27:40.510
He won't stand a chance!

27:41.680 --> 27:42.310
Fortunately, the Three Children

27:42.350 --> 27:43.720
used to open the Three Thousand Realms Tower

27:44.200 --> 27:44.830
are no longer

27:44.880 --> 27:46.110
under Dun Tian's control.

27:46.640 --> 27:47.960
Now we just need to eliminate

27:47.960 --> 27:49.590
the shadow people controlling the major sects

27:49.790 --> 27:50.590
and reclaim the spiritual channels,

27:51.070 --> 27:51.550
and Dun Tian

27:51.920 --> 27:53.240
will have no more tricks up his sleeve.

27:56.030 --> 27:56.480
Great.

27:58.200 --> 27:59.480
You help me reclaim Mount Scarlet Flame.

27:59.830 --> 28:01.080
Then we'll deal with

28:01.110 --> 28:02.270
the imposter pretending to be me together.

28:02.490 --> 28:04.050
Everything will be resolved.

28:04.630 --> 28:05.350
Let's cooperate.

28:06.200 --> 28:07.000
You're trying to persuade us

28:07.030 --> 28:08.110
into helping you reclaim your sect.

28:11.580 --> 28:13.030
We'll go to Mount Scarlet Flame

28:13.310 --> 28:14.480
to eliminate your shadow man,

28:15.260 --> 28:16.740
but we can handle this on our own.

28:18.110 --> 28:18.880
Your spiritual power now

28:18.880 --> 28:20.030
is so weak that there's nothing you can do.

28:20.400 --> 28:21.200
What good are you?

28:21.310 --> 28:21.830
I...

28:28.400 --> 28:29.480
I know a secret passage.

28:30.020 --> 28:31.210
We can sneak into

28:31.240 --> 28:32.110
the interior of Mount Scarlet Flame.

28:32.310 --> 28:33.550
We'll catch them off guard.

28:33.960 --> 28:34.880
It'll save us a lot of trouble.

28:35.350 --> 28:35.880
What do you think?

28:36.350 --> 28:36.920
Deal.

28:40.590 --> 28:41.070
However,

28:41.790 --> 28:42.480
about attacking Mount Scarlet Flame,

28:42.480 --> 28:43.550
there's still a tricky problem.

28:44.590 --> 28:45.510
We also need to prevent ourselves

28:45.680 --> 28:46.550
from being contaminated by the blue blood.

28:47.980 --> 28:48.850
These past few days,

28:48.870 --> 28:50.540
I've focused on how to forge Shadow Bells.

28:51.110 --> 28:52.510
If we carry this bell with us,

28:52.750 --> 28:53.960
once something attacks us,

28:54.070 --> 28:55.720
it can transform into a Bell Shadow Barrier,

28:55.920 --> 28:56.880
protecting the person inside.

28:57.270 --> 28:57.960
However,

28:58.080 --> 28:59.510
its energy is still a bit weak at the moment.

29:00.260 --> 29:01.590
I'll find a way to strengthen it further.

29:01.920 --> 29:02.680
It should be able to

29:02.680 --> 29:03.720
resist the attack of the blue blood.

29:04.480 --> 29:04.920
Baishan,

29:05.750 --> 29:06.790
help Mr. Zeng make Shadow Bells

29:06.790 --> 29:08.150
these two days.

29:08.640 --> 29:09.640
Yes, Master.

29:10.240 --> 29:11.000
Once the bells are ready,

29:11.310 --> 29:12.550
we'll immediately attack Mount Scarlet Flame.

29:12.830 --> 29:13.350
Wait.

29:14.310 --> 29:15.200
There's one more thing.

29:16.070 --> 29:17.030
I do know the secret passage

29:17.030 --> 29:18.200
to Mount Scarlet Flame.

29:19.400 --> 29:20.480
But I have a condition.

29:21.310 --> 29:21.960
Su Yishui,

29:22.880 --> 29:23.750
sleep beside me.

29:28.230 --> 29:28.920
I haven't slept

29:28.920 --> 29:30.030
for several days.

29:30.320 --> 29:31.480
The imposter merely

29:31.510 --> 29:32.430
uses the demonic power

29:32.510 --> 29:33.350
nurtured by the Two-headed Deceptive Python

29:33.560 --> 29:34.330
to invade my dreams from afar

29:34.360 --> 29:35.950
and steal my spiritual power

29:36.070 --> 29:36.920
when I'm exhausted and defenseless.

29:37.260 --> 29:38.500
But if there is

29:39.160 --> 29:40.160
a strong spiritual power interference

29:40.450 --> 29:41.420
beside me,

29:41.880 --> 29:42.960
he won't be able to succeed.

29:44.440 --> 29:45.720
You help me protect myself.

29:46.480 --> 29:47.240
I'm not interested.

29:48.310 --> 29:48.880
Su Yishui.

29:49.830 --> 29:50.480
We're now

29:50.480 --> 29:51.590
in the same boat after all.

29:51.880 --> 29:52.790
If I'm worn to death,

29:53.090 --> 29:54.480
it won't do you any good either.

29:58.160 --> 29:59.650
You might as well let me

29:59.670 --> 30:00.780
have a sound sleep.

30:01.160 --> 30:01.790
I promise

30:02.730 --> 30:03.520
I'll never cause trouble

30:03.550 --> 30:04.590
for Mount Wester in the future.

30:08.570 --> 30:09.200
Su Yishui.

30:09.960 --> 30:10.510
Su Yishui.

30:11.330 --> 30:12.640
Only you and Mu Qingge here

30:12.720 --> 30:13.310
can help me protect myself

30:13.330 --> 30:14.090
with your cultivation.

30:14.880 --> 30:15.550
If you don't help me,

30:16.110 --> 30:16.720
fine,

30:17.910 --> 30:18.980
I'll ask Mu Qingge.

30:20.360 --> 30:21.880
Having a sweet and soft beauty

30:21.910 --> 30:22.540
by my side,

30:22.950 --> 30:24.080
even if I die in my dreams,

30:24.430 --> 30:25.700
I'll be a dashing ghost.

30:27.270 --> 30:27.960
Beauty Mu,

30:28.270 --> 30:28.750
I...

30:29.540 --> 30:30.160
Come with me.

30:34.200 --> 30:35.240
Could there be fatalities

30:35.480 --> 30:36.350
between Master and Wei Jiu?

30:43.070 --> 30:44.030
Behave yourself.

30:47.570 --> 30:48.130
Don't worry.

30:48.510 --> 30:49.030
Now that you're with me,

30:49.400 --> 30:49.880
I definitely

30:49.880 --> 30:50.960
won't go after her.

30:54.020 --> 30:54.910
Then I'll make myself at home.

31:13.580 --> 31:14.410
You sleep on this side.

31:33.310 --> 31:35.330
I haven't slept this comfortably for a long time.

31:39.030 --> 31:40.340
Get out since you're awake.

31:46.320 --> 31:47.320
You even helped me

31:47.440 --> 31:48.110
absorb back the spiritual power

31:48.130 --> 31:48.960
from the impostor?

31:49.470 --> 31:51.270
I was afraid you'd slow us down later.

31:53.270 --> 31:54.830
I've always been discerning about kindness and enmity,

31:55.070 --> 31:56.270
and I always repay kindness.

31:57.040 --> 31:58.190
You've helped me this time.

31:59.310 --> 31:59.790
Tell me,

32:00.590 --> 32:01.720
how do you want me to thank you?

32:05.170 --> 32:06.170
Then please do me a favor,

32:06.200 --> 32:07.550
take the quilt you used and throw it away.

32:09.240 --> 32:09.880
I like keeping things clean.

32:10.070 --> 32:10.640
I can't stand it.

32:10.960 --> 32:11.440
I...

32:12.200 --> 32:12.680
I'm wearing

32:12.680 --> 32:13.750
a brocade silk robe.

32:13.880 --> 32:14.920
After leaving Mount Scarlet Flame,

32:14.920 --> 32:15.870
I specially changed into a new outfit.

32:16.000 --> 32:16.830
It's very clean!

32:17.270 --> 32:18.640
Sovereign Wei, your voice is loud and clear.

32:19.840 --> 32:20.970
It seems the spiritual energy in your Dantian

32:21.000 --> 32:21.550
is quite abundant.

32:22.110 --> 32:22.550
You...

32:23.960 --> 32:24.440
I...

32:25.350 --> 32:25.830
You...

32:28.000 --> 32:29.310
How dare you threaten me!

32:45.640 --> 32:46.960
You were watching Wei Jiu all night.

32:47.350 --> 32:48.310
You must have stayed up all night, haven't you?

32:52.350 --> 32:53.000
I'm very tired.

32:53.510 --> 32:54.720
My wounds haven't healed yet.

32:56.510 --> 32:57.650
Then after having breakfast,

32:57.680 --> 32:58.790
you should go rest for a while.

32:59.180 --> 33:00.700
Don't worry about Zeng Yi and the others

33:00.960 --> 33:01.750
forging magic items.

33:02.110 --> 33:02.790
I'll go help them.

33:22.960 --> 33:23.920
What smells so good?

33:26.000 --> 33:26.720
Steamed buns?

33:30.750 --> 33:31.440
They're delicious.

33:32.800 --> 33:33.400
Beauty Mu,

33:33.920 --> 33:34.680
did you make these?

33:36.580 --> 33:37.390
The sweet potato chips you made

33:37.410 --> 33:38.230
and gave me before

33:38.250 --> 33:38.900
were especially delicious.

33:39.240 --> 33:40.480
I didn't expect that other things you made

33:40.510 --> 33:41.270
would be even more delicious.

33:41.920 --> 33:42.550
Sweet potato chips?

33:43.160 --> 33:44.640
Back when we were at Heavenly Meridian Mountain,

33:44.720 --> 33:45.920
you were meditating to heal your wounds.

33:46.210 --> 33:47.210
I saw he was starving,

33:47.270 --> 33:48.030
so I just gave him some.

33:53.030 --> 33:54.110
You haven't tried them?

33:54.600 --> 33:55.170
You don't know

33:55.200 --> 33:56.350
how sweet those sweet potato chips were!

33:56.350 --> 33:57.900
Eat your steamed buns and shut your mouth.

34:04.030 --> 34:04.720
Wei Jiu!

34:05.240 --> 34:06.000
Did you drink all

34:06.030 --> 34:07.350
the good wine I had stored?

34:10.550 --> 34:11.960
Since you have nowhere else to go,

34:12.010 --> 34:12.560
can't you have some

34:12.590 --> 34:13.510
decency as a guest?

34:13.590 --> 34:14.480
Drinking your wine

34:14.500 --> 34:15.320
is showing respect for

34:15.320 --> 34:16.480
your title as the Alcohol Immortal.

34:17.800 --> 34:18.150
Fine.

34:18.960 --> 34:20.110
Let's not talk about the wine for now.

34:20.960 --> 34:21.940
I just saw you

34:21.969 --> 34:23.000
throw away the quilt

34:23.030 --> 34:24.280
that Ranran sewed for Su Yishui.

34:24.929 --> 34:26.730
I couldn't even stop you even if I wanted to.

34:30.480 --> 34:31.880
When Su Yishui

34:31.900 --> 34:32.880
was severely injured and unconscious

34:32.900 --> 34:34.010
and struggling with hypothermia,

34:34.320 --> 34:35.230
Ranran

34:35.380 --> 34:36.820
stayed up for several nights

34:37.110 --> 34:39.670
sewing it stitch by stitch with her own hands.

34:43.590 --> 34:44.320
Where did you throw it?

34:46.020 --> 34:47.320
I just tossed it on some random hillside.

34:47.510 --> 34:48.469
I don't know where it ended up.

35:00.320 --> 35:01.190
Where is he?

35:01.760 --> 35:02.710
I've searched for him around the mountain,

35:02.710 --> 35:03.670
but there's no sign of him.

35:23.230 --> 35:24.710
You're quite caring, aren't you?

35:25.880 --> 35:27.400
I didn't know you sewed the quilt.

35:27.960 --> 35:29.510
Otherwise, I would never have let Wei Jiu touch it.

35:30.800 --> 35:32.590
It's just an ordinary quilt.

35:32.920 --> 35:33.880
Just leave it be.

35:34.150 --> 35:35.630
Why bother going to such lengths to find it?

35:35.960 --> 35:37.110
This is not an ordinary quilt.

35:37.440 --> 35:38.920
It's the quilt you sewed for me with your own hands.

35:39.320 --> 35:40.550
It's more important than anything else.

35:42.150 --> 35:42.760
All right.

35:43.280 --> 35:44.320
If you like,

35:44.550 --> 35:45.190
I'll embroider some bamboo patterns on it

35:45.190 --> 35:46.110
for you later. How's that?

35:47.510 --> 35:48.510
If possible,

35:49.190 --> 35:50.550
it would be even better to add a pair of mandarin ducks.

35:51.760 --> 35:53.400
You're quite good at pushing your luck,

35:53.480 --> 35:54.070
Shui.

35:56.030 --> 35:56.630
Don't forget,

35:56.800 --> 35:57.920
I am the master now.

35:58.320 --> 35:59.590
What kind of Master are you?

35:59.840 --> 36:00.840
You don't even know how to wash a quilt.

36:01.320 --> 36:02.510
Let me teach you.

36:15.000 --> 36:15.480
All right.

36:17.400 --> 36:19.070
I didn't expect such a trivial thing like washing a quilt

36:19.510 --> 36:21.070
to be so satisfying.

36:23.670 --> 36:24.070
Ranran,

36:25.030 --> 36:26.000
you have no idea

36:26.630 --> 36:28.000
how much I cherish everything at present.

36:29.480 --> 36:30.150
So I will never

36:30.150 --> 36:30.960
let Dun Tian have his way

36:31.110 --> 36:31.920
and take everything away from me.

36:39.280 --> 36:40.510
So you two are here.

36:46.920 --> 36:48.430
In broad daylight,

36:49.570 --> 36:50.170
you...

36:51.800 --> 36:52.960
You're both Heavenly Sovereigns.

36:53.490 --> 36:54.380
Instead of cultivating with a clear mind

36:54.440 --> 36:55.250
and striving forward with few desires,

36:55.840 --> 36:56.710
you two have the leisure

36:56.980 --> 36:57.750
to be all lovey-dovey here.

36:59.440 --> 37:00.760
Why are you always such an eyesore?

37:01.410 --> 37:02.120
Sovereign Wei,

37:02.450 --> 37:03.730
you're just being envious of us

37:03.760 --> 37:04.710
because you lost someone you love.

37:05.150 --> 37:05.920
Originally, there was

37:05.920 --> 37:07.320
someone who truly cared for you.

37:07.590 --> 37:08.440
Tu Jiuyuan was willing

37:08.460 --> 37:09.530
to sacrifice her life for you.

37:09.880 --> 37:11.230
Yet you didn't appreciate it.

37:11.440 --> 37:11.880
You...

37:17.000 --> 37:17.710
Once,

37:18.480 --> 37:19.520
she was willing to die for me.

37:21.510 --> 37:22.320
But thinking about

37:22.510 --> 37:23.670
the day on Mount Scarlet Flame

37:24.480 --> 37:26.030
when she attacked me without mercy,

37:26.840 --> 37:27.960
I dare not to think

37:28.440 --> 37:29.280
if she has already...

37:29.890 --> 37:31.410
You're worried that the current Tu Jiuyuan

37:31.440 --> 37:32.110
is a fake

37:32.670 --> 37:34.320
and the real one has already died?

37:37.870 --> 37:38.950
The imposter

37:39.250 --> 37:40.850
didn't even spare my wife and child.

37:41.230 --> 37:42.030
Then I

37:42.260 --> 37:43.610
will absolutely not let him off either.

37:43.890 --> 37:44.800
Wife and child?

37:45.110 --> 37:46.110
Did they acknowledge you?

37:46.390 --> 37:47.910
You're quite good at pushing your advantage, aren't you?

37:48.510 --> 37:49.030
I...

37:49.960 --> 37:50.400
Furthermore,

37:50.840 --> 37:51.760
I've heard that under the cliff at the back mountain of Mount Scarlet Flame,

37:51.760 --> 37:53.550
demonic creatures are lurking around.

37:54.030 --> 37:54.590
Do you really think

37:54.610 --> 37:55.760
that after falling and losing consciousness,

37:55.760 --> 37:56.800
you could still be alive and well

37:57.190 --> 37:58.480
because you were lucky?

37:59.590 --> 38:00.400
What do you mean?

38:04.110 --> 38:05.070
Are you saying

38:05.670 --> 38:07.550
that she actually protected me that day?

38:39.170 --> 38:40.000
You figure it out yourself.

38:44.920 --> 38:46.000
I came here to tell you

38:46.280 --> 38:47.150
that Shadow Bells are ready.

38:47.630 --> 38:48.670
We're going back now

38:48.960 --> 38:50.000
to save my wife and child.

38:50.510 --> 38:51.320
Whether she acknowledges it or not,

38:51.670 --> 38:52.510
I've made up my mind about this matter.

38:57.360 --> 38:59.000
It's in the direction of the Eternal Sect.

38:59.480 --> 39:01.030
The spiritual channel of the Eternal Sect has been opened.

39:02.000 --> 39:03.070
Without the pivot of the formation to open the tower

39:03.530 --> 39:04.530
and the Three Children in hand,

39:05.030 --> 39:06.080
Dun Tian hasn't given up

39:06.110 --> 39:07.320
his plan to open the Three Thousand Realms Tower.

39:08.840 --> 39:09.400
Indeed,

39:09.760 --> 39:10.800
he must still have some hidden tricks up his sleeve.

39:11.670 --> 39:12.400
No matter what,

39:13.000 --> 39:14.230
we must eliminate all shadow people,

39:14.800 --> 39:15.440
reclaim the Heavenly Sects,

39:15.800 --> 39:16.760
and close all spiritual channels.

39:17.070 --> 39:17.920
Without the Three Children

39:17.960 --> 39:18.590
and spiritual channels,

39:18.840 --> 39:19.670
what can he possibly do?

39:21.070 --> 39:22.280
Have the Alcohol Immortal and Liang Wumeng

39:22.380 --> 39:23.220
stay and guard Mount Cuiwei.

39:23.590 --> 39:24.670
We need to secure at least one stronghold first.

39:25.000 --> 39:25.630
The rest of us

39:25.940 --> 39:27.110
will head to Mount Scarlet Flame now.

39:39.590 --> 39:40.400
What's that?

39:41.480 --> 39:42.510
It's the spiritual channel of the Heavenly Sects.

39:43.720 --> 39:45.150
It should be in the direction of the Hollow Sect.

39:46.920 --> 39:48.630
Dun Tian is about to open the Three Thousand Realms Tower.

39:49.590 --> 39:50.360
So,

39:50.920 --> 39:52.360
you still want to go to what you call

39:53.320 --> 39:55.070
the most desirable place.

39:55.440 --> 39:57.110
Who doesn't want everything to go their way?

39:58.480 --> 39:59.880
I have too many regrets

40:01.360 --> 40:02.510
and too much remorse.

40:04.440 --> 40:05.510
Since I have this opportunity,

40:05.510 --> 40:06.360
of course, I want to try

40:06.380 --> 40:07.420
for a different outcome.

40:12.920 --> 40:13.590
Your Highness.

40:16.070 --> 40:17.000
Do you still remember this?

40:48.230 --> 40:49.110
I don't believe

40:49.590 --> 40:50.320
I

40:50.400 --> 40:51.150
can't conquer

40:51.150 --> 40:52.630
this little clay ocarina.

40:53.920 --> 40:54.670
Once I've mastered it,

40:54.920 --> 40:55.840
I'll play it for you.

40:56.960 --> 40:57.670
All right.

41:03.890 --> 41:05.290
Youth is truly wonderful.

41:06.360 --> 41:07.070
Unfortunately,

41:09.480 --> 41:10.880
it's gone forever.

41:12.440 --> 41:13.280
This clay ocarina

41:13.800 --> 41:15.150
is just an object.

41:16.110 --> 41:17.070
In fact,

41:17.550 --> 41:19.230
it's not even the original one.

41:20.590 --> 41:22.230
It's the memories associated with it

41:22.800 --> 41:23.800
that can evoke ripples and nostalgia

41:23.800 --> 41:25.230
in your mind.

41:26.960 --> 41:27.840
The place

41:28.550 --> 41:29.520
you mentioned,

41:29.550 --> 41:30.320
the so-called desirable realm.

41:31.110 --> 41:32.150
Does it have all of this?

41:33.630 --> 41:35.360
Qingge is someone you've longed for.

41:36.230 --> 41:37.670
The version of Qingge in that realm

41:38.150 --> 41:39.110
won't share the experiences and memories

41:39.320 --> 41:40.280
in this realm

41:40.280 --> 41:41.480
with you.

41:42.590 --> 41:43.880
So what's the point?

41:57.370 --> 42:02.090
♫I'm heading home, carrying a load of firewood♫

42:02.470 --> 42:07.080
♫The folk song is so pleasant and sung aloud♫

42:07.350 --> 42:12.090
♫My whole family is longing for my return♫

42:09.840 --> 42:11.000
It seems I can hear this song

42:11.030 --> 42:11.840
every day.

42:12.310 --> 42:16.500
♫Hurry and get back home♫

42:12.840 --> 42:14.200
What exactly are they singing?

42:16.280 --> 42:17.320
They are singing the praises

42:18.000 --> 42:19.800
of a peaceful and prosperous era

42:19.990 --> 42:24.710
♫I'm heading home, carrying a load of firewood♫

42:20.630 --> 42:21.190
and

42:21.510 --> 42:22.840
praying that such a life

42:22.860 --> 42:24.020
will last forever.

42:25.110 --> 42:29.130
♫The folk song is so pleasant and sung aloud♫

42:29.990 --> 42:34.870
♫My whole family is longing for my return♫

42:34.890 --> 42:39.290
♫Hurry and get back home♫

42:51.020 --> 42:52.140
Sleepy Poison?

42:55.590 --> 42:56.360
Why?

42:57.120 --> 42:58.560
You want me to take this thing

42:58.590 --> 42:59.360
and fall into a deep sleep,

42:59.840 --> 43:00.360
so that

43:00.590 --> 43:02.070
you can kill me?

43:03.760 --> 43:04.480
My Lord, please spare me.

43:04.580 --> 43:05.680
I made a mistake.

43:05.770 --> 43:06.600
I will never dare to do it again!

43:08.240 --> 43:09.910
When did you realize I was a fake?

43:10.360 --> 43:11.480
My spiritual power was stolen.

43:11.970 --> 43:13.160
Did you have something to do with it?

43:14.230 --> 43:15.350
I know nothing, My Lord.

43:15.670 --> 43:16.590
I absolutely

43:16.590 --> 43:17.400
don't have such an ability.

43:17.800 --> 43:18.760
Please spare me, My Lord.

43:35.630 --> 43:36.840
Is this the secret passage you mentioned?

43:37.480 --> 43:38.760
How is it any different from a dog hole?

43:42.630 --> 43:44.320
That's why it's called "secret passage."

43:44.630 --> 43:45.230
Don't tell me

43:45.510 --> 43:47.150
you think it should be installed with a red-lacquered grand door?
